line of business, your project.

00:45:07.320 --> 00:45:09.630
What are you trying
to design for?

00:45:09.630 --> 00:45:11.260
And then use these links.

00:45:11.260 --> 00:45:18.090
So bit.ly/NET201-VPC for our
VPC best practices guide.

00:45:18.090 --> 00:45:23.860
NET201-ENT for best practices
for enterprise organizations.

00:45:23.860 --> 00:45:27.600
NET201-POLICY for understanding
policy design as it

00:45:27.600 --> 00:45:30.270
